Package: CrowdQCplus
Type: Package
Title: Enhanced quality control for crowdsourced data from citizen weather stations
Version: 1.1.2
Date: 2026-04-29
Author: Daniel Fenner, Tom Grassmann, Benjamin Bechtel, Matthias Demuzere, Jonas Kittner, Fred Meier
Authors@R: c(
    person("Daniel", "Fenner", email = "d.fenner@tu-berlin.de", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Tom", "Grassmann", role = "aut"),
    person("Benjamin", "Bechtel", role = "aut"),
